{"title": "Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit", "pageid": 15691, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Conjuration spells", "Ritual spells", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Find_Familiar_Quasit.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Find_Familiar_Quasit.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Quasit.webp, /w/images/1/1b/Find_Familiar_Quasit.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Find_Familiar_Quasit.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Quasit.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Find_Familiar_Quasit.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 conjuration spell</a>. It is a special version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/30px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\">Find Familiar: Quasit</a> that summons the <a href=\"/wiki/Quasit\" title=\"Quasit\">quasit</a> named <a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(familiar)\" title=\"Shovel (familiar)\">Shovel</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSummon a familiar with the form of a quasit that can turn Invisible and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scare\" title=\"Scare\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Scare_Icon.webp/20px-Scare_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Scare_Icon.webp/30px-Scare_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Scare_Icon.webp/40px-Scare_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Scare_Icon.webp/20px-Scare_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Scare_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scare\" title=\"Scare\">Scare</a> enemies.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/38px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\">Ritual</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsibl