e bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Lash at a creature to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frighten\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frighten</a></span> it. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Can be permanently acquired by certain arcane casting classes by selecting the appropriate dialogue choices when speaking with <a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(familiar)\" title=\"Shovel (familiar)\">Shovel</a>. See <a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(familiar)#Summoning_and_permanently_acquiring_Shovel\" title=\"Shovel (familiar)\">Summoning and permanently acquiring Shovel</a> for details.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a>  can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit\" title=\"Scroll of Summon Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Summon_Quasit\" title=\"Scroll of Summon Quasit\">Scroll of Summon Quasit</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034444\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.101 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.106 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4280/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 85069/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 31826/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1547241/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n144.54%  126.444     49 Template:Trim\n100.00%   87.479      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   87.479      1 -total\n 22.51%   19.692      3 Template:SpellAction\n 16.72%   14.624      9 Template:Icon_text\n 13.93%   12.190      2 Template:SmSAI\n 13.93%   12.182      1 Template:Creature\n 12.64%   11.054      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 11.66%   10.197      3 Template:Spell_action/format\n 10.90%    9.538      1 Template:Creature/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:15691-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034444 and revision id 330924. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}